        ∃ N : Captain H i C (d x) (v x) (t x) A a (r x) (B x) (q x) k χ, Herd H N.conduit A (B x) k := by
  obtain ⟨n,h⟩:= timing P Q; refine ⟨n, fun L hL D hD i χ W hW μ hm o=>?_⟩
